==Serbian==
===Etymology===
A [[Slavic]] ([[Serbian]], [[Croatian]] and [[Macedonian]]) male name meaning ''mountain man'', ''man from the mountain'' or ''highlander'' that comes from the word ''[[гора]]'', meaning ''mountain''

